      <activity id="d37b3d44-d887-5474-949f-451ed292717c" activityNameId="3f816248-befd-555f-bc9c-2304eb6c80a3" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Disposal, exhaust air roof hood, steel, DN 400</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Disposal, exhaust air roof hood, steel, DN 400
Disposal of a roof mounted exhaust air hood made of zinc coated steel. Compatible with  spiral seam duct of 400 mm diameter. Weight per element 17 kg;
UUID: 33f686d9-db24-49b2-acf9-5e0ac51365ab
Transport to dismantling facilities, machines for handling in sorting plant, electricity demand for sorting plant, final disposal of waste material. Cut-off to recycling for metals.
Location: Specific to the technology mix encountered in sorting plants in Switzerland
Technology: Disposal to a sorting plant assumed. Metal pieces and copper in cables and electronic devices are recycled, plastic parts are incinerated, inert wastes (e.g. rock wool) are landfilled.
Time period: Amount of material investigated in 2003. Disposal technology mix as used in late 1990ies
Production volume: na
Sampling: Questionnaire and assumptions. 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_33f686d9-db24-49b2-acf9-5e0ac51365ab.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
